Package: internetdata
Type: Package
Title: Client for the 'InternetData' API
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Mslm Dev", email = "support@internetdata.io", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph")))
Description: The official client for the 'InternetData' API
    <https://internetdata.io>. Failed requests are retried as the API's
    'Retry-After' asks, and every answer is checked against the API's published
    specification before it is handed back.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://internetdata.io, https://docs.internetdata.io,
    https://github.com/internetdata/sdk-r
BugReports: https://github.com/internetdata/sdk-r/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports:
    curl (>= 5.0.0),
    jsonlite (>= 1.8.0),
    utils
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    webfakes (>= 1.3.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
